WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.224
Unit three. Physical Activity!

2
00:00:04.174 --> 00:00:07.731
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.781 --> 00:00:11.208
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.258 --> 00:00:15.043
Today we learn about Physical Activity. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.077 --> 00:00:19.511
Stretch. Say it with me. Stretch!

6
00:00:23.008 --> 00:00:27.708
Warm-up. Say it with me. Warm-up!

7
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.750
Sport. Say it with me. Sport!

8
00:00:38.252 --> 00:00:41.335
Team. Say it with me. Team!

9
00:00:44.818 --> 00:00:48.402
Endurance. Say it with me. Endurance!

10
00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:55.437
Muscle. Say it with me. Muscle!

11
00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:02.634
Flexible. Say it with me. Flexible!

12
00:01:06.185 --> 00:01:09.768
Active. Say it with me. Active!

13
00:01:13.224 --> 00:01:22.729
Before a sport, I always stretch and do a warm-up. Playing on a team builds endurance and strengthens my muscles. Staying active also keeps my body flexible.

14
00:01:22.779 --> 00:01:24.020
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:30.650
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:31.850
Sport!

17
00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:38.048
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:39.248
Flexible!

19
00:01:40.245 --> 00:01:48.471
Did you know? A warm-up — like gentle jogging and swinging your arms — gets your muscles ready and helps prevent injuries!

20
00:01:48.521 --> 00:01:50.500
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:51.175 --> 00:01:59.208
Think and answer. What sport or physical activity do you enjoy?

22
00:01:59.258 --> 00:02:00.408
Great answer!

23
00:02:01.572 --> 00:02:06.470
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:09.131
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

